[{"answer":"Hi Thomas, how are you enjoying the course so far?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I think it's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Remind me, why did you decide to study sports science?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Didn't you want to be a professional athlete when you were at school?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that was my goal,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and all my classmates assumed I would achieve it; they thought I was brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"That must have been a nice feeling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Mm, I thought I could win anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"There was no one who could run faster than me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly, so what happened?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Did your mum and dad want you to be more 'academic'?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Not at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps they should have pushed me harder, though.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you mean?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I should have practised more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"What makes you say that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I went out to Kenya for a couple of weeks to train...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Really! I didn't know that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I was chosen to go there out of loads of kids and run with some of the top teenage athletes in the world.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"And... I was so calm about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I just kept thinking how fortunate I was.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"What a great chance this was!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone back home was so proud of me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"But once we started competing, I very quickly realised I wasn't good enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"That must have been a huge shock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought 'this can't be happening'!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I was used to winning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry to hear that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"It's OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm over it now","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think it's much better to do a university course","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and this one has such a variety of sports-related areas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's going to be good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I agree, I chose it because of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"So Jeanne, have you thought of any ideas for the discussion session next week on technology and sport?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"We have to cover more than one sport, don't we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, we always think technology is about the future,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but we could gather some ideas about past developments in sport.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Look at early types of equipment perhaps?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I remember reading something about table tennis bats once,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"how they ended up being covered with pimpled rubber.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Cos they were just wooden at first, I'd imagine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"In about the 1920s,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"a factory was making rolls of the rubber in bulk for something like horse harnesses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Really!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, and someone realised that it would make a perfect covering for the wooden bats.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"So what about cricket,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"that's had a few innovative changes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe the pads they wear on their legs?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think they've changed much but, I'm just looking on the internet...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and it says that when the first cricket helmet came in, in 1978,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/53.mp3"},{"answer":"the Australian batsman who first wore it was booed and jeered by people watching because it was so ugly!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Wow, players have to protect themselves from getting hurt!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean everyone wears one now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Mm, unlike the cycle helmet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, unless you're a professional,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/58.mp3"},{"answer":"but you're right, many ordinary bikers don't wear a helmet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Hey, look at these pictures of original helmet designs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/60.mp3"},{"answer":"This one looks like an upside-down bowl!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Yet, the woman's laughing,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/62.mp3"},{"answer":"she's so proud to be wearing it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It says serious cyclists ended up with wet hair from all the hard exercise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/64.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess that's why they have large air vents in them now","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/65.mp3"},{"answer":"so that the skin can breathe more easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/66.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so we've done helmets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/67.mp3"},{"answer":"What about golf balls or better still golf clubs,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/68.mp3"},{"answer":"they've changed a lot.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I remember my great grandfather telling me that because a club was made entirely of wood,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/70.mp3"},{"answer":"it would easily break and players had to get another.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/71.mp3"},{"answer":"There's no wood at all in them now, is there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/72.mp3"},{"answer":"No, they're much more powerful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/73.mp3"},{"answer":"The same must be true of hockey sticks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think so because players still use wooden sticks today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/75.mp3"},{"answer":"What it does say here, though,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/76.mp3"},{"answer":"is that when the game started you had to produce a stick yourself.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess they just weren't being manufactured.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/78.mp3"},{"answer":"So, one more perhaps.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/79.mp3"},{"answer":"What about football?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I know the first balls were made of animal skin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, they covered them with pieces of leather that were stitched together,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/82.mp3"},{"answer":"but... the balls let in water when it rained.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/83.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that would have made them much heavier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/84.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/85.mp3"},{"answer":"You can imagine the damage to player's necks when the ball was headed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/86.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, how painful that must have been!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, well, I think we can put together some useful ideas...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-17-test-4-section-3-2022-12-27-23-53-23/88.mp3"}]
